Third-party notices — finaudit-agent
====================================

This repository does not redistribute any third-party corpus or dictionary.

Data
----
- Financial statement values are extracted from annual reports published on
  CNINFO (http://www.cninfo.com.cn), China's statutory disclosure venue for
  listed-company filings. Source PDFs are NOT committed to this repository;
  each extracted value carries the SHA-256 of the PDF it came from, so any
  figure can be re-derived from the public original.
- AKShare (https://github.com/akfamily/akshare, MIT) is used only as an
  optional cross-check source, never as the authoritative one. See
  DECISIONS.md D-013.

Libraries
---------
- pdfplumber (MIT) — PDF text and table extraction.
  This project deliberately avoids AGPL-licensed PDF components; the
  constraint is machine-enforced by scripts/verify_deps.py. See D-014.
- PyYAML (MIT) — the only third-party import in the service runtime closure.

Not included here
-----------------
- The Chinese financial sentiment dictionary (Jiang et al.) is referenced by
  its own NOTICE in a separate project and is NOT distributed in this
  repository.
